---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Verified against the repo on 2026-10-20:
//   python -m pytest tests -q  ->  2514 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed (2514 collected)
// Keep these in sync with the code before every deploy.
const TESTS_TOTAL = '2,514';
---

<Layout
	title="Semantic Signal — an LLM trading agent that reads charts | qrak.org"
	description="Open-source LLM trading agent: 1920×1080 chart vision, 768D memory of closed-trade experiences, deterministic risk checks. Simulated capital by default."
>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="badge">Open source • Python 3.13 • simulated capital by default</div>
		<h1>An LLM trading agent that reads candlestick charts and learns from its own closed trades.</h1>
		<p class="hero-sub">
			Every four hours it renders a 1920×1080 chart, sends it to a multimodal model with 79
			indicators, the news context and its trade memory, and runs the answer through deterministic
			risk checks before booking a paper trade.
		</p>
		<div class="cta-buttons">
			<a href="/results/" class="btn btn-primary">Results</a>
			<a href="https://semanticsignal.qrak.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary">Live dashboard ↗</a>
			<a href="/story/" class="btn btn-outline">Development history</a>
			<a href="https://github.com/qrak/LLM_trader" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline">GitHub ↗</a>
		</div>

		<dl class="status">
			<div><dt>trading</dt><dd>simulated capital (paper)</dd></div>
			<div><dt>executor</dt><dd>exchange testnet, no real funds</dd></div>
			<div><dt>tests</dt><dd>{TESTS_TOTAL}, ~145 s, ruff and pyright clean</dd></div>
			<div><dt>providers</dt><dd>DeepSeek, Google, OpenRouter, LM Studio</dd></div>
		</dl>
	</section>

	<section class="features-grid">
		<div class="card">
			<div class="card-tag">chart_vision</div>
			<h3>Chart images, not only indicator values</h3>
			<p>A 1920×1080 Plotly candlestick chart with SMA, RSI, CMF and OBV goes to the model with the
			numeric stack. It reads wick geometry and volume from the picture, and every number it cites is
			checked against the computed value.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="card">
			<div class="card-tag">vector_memory</div>
			<h3>Memory of closed trades</h3>
			<p>Closed trades are embedded with <code>BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5</code> into ChromaDB. Before each
			decision the bot retrieves the three most similar past setups, each carrying a surprise ratio so
			a lucky win does not become a rule.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="card">
			<div class="card-tag">risk_governance</div>
			<h3>Deterministic limits around the model</h3>
			<p>The model proposes a trade; symbol restrictions, position caps and stop/target validation stay
			deterministic. Sizing is capped and uses fixed fallback profiles.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="card">
			<div class="card-tag">executor</div>
			<h3>Reasoning and execution are separate processes</h3>
			<p>The engine emits one JSON decision; a second service places CCXT orders and writes a verdict
			journal the engine reads back, so the bot confirms what happened to its order instead of assuming
			it.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="story-preview">
		<h2>Development history</h2>
		<p>
			Built in the evenings after warehouse shifts in Wrocław. The repository holds {TESTS_TOTAL} tests,
			an AGENTS.md per package, and an executor that runs against an exchange testnet.
		</p>
		<a href="/story/" class="read-more-link">Read the full history →</a>
	</section>

	<section class="articles-section">
		<h2>Articles</h2>
		<div class="articles-grid">
			<a href="/articles/chart-vision/" class="article-card">
				<h3>How the bot reads charts</h3>
				<p>How the chart is rendered and what the model is asked to see.</p>
			</a>
			<a href="/articles/vector-memory/" class="article-card">
				<h3>Vector memory</h3>
				<p>How closed trades become embeddings the bot retrieves before a decision.</p>
			</a>
			<a href="/articles/executor-separation/" class="article-card">
				<h3>Paper → live: the executor</h3>
				<p>Why order placement is a separate service, and what is missing before real capital.</p>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="verify">
		<h2>Sources</h2>
		<p>Every number on this page comes from a file in the repository:</p>
		<pre><code>chart image 1920x1080    src/analyzer/pattern_engine/chart_generator.py
market data, 50 lvls     config/config.ini · src/analyzer/data_fetcher.py
trade memory 768D        src/trading/vector_memory.py (BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5)
risk limits, pre-entry   src/trading/position_management.py
agent docs, 9 files    AGENTS.md + one per package (src/trading, src/analyzer, ...)
tests {TESTS_TOTAL}            python -m pytest tests -q   -&gt; all passing, 0 skipped</code></pre>
	</section>

	<section class="risk-disclaimer">
		<p><strong>Risk disclaimer:</strong> experimental software, not financial advice. It trades simulated
		capital by default and has lost money on paper during development.
		<a href="/disclaimer/">Full disclaimer</a>.</p>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2.5rem 1rem 3rem;
	}

	.badge {
		display: inline-block;
		background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
		color: var(--accent-emerald);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);
		padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.6rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.22;
		margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
		max-width: 21ch;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.hero-sub {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto 2.25rem;
	}

	.cta-buttons {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.status {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 2.75rem auto 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		padding: 0.5rem 0;
		font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.status > div {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.25rem;
	}

	.status dt {
		color: var(--text-dim);
		min-width: 9.5rem;
	}

	.status dt::after {
		content: ":";
	}

	.status dd {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.btn {
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1rem;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: var(--accent-emerald);
		color: #0b0f19;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: #059669;
		color: #0b0f19;
		box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
		border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
	}

	.btn-secondary:hover {
		background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25);
		color: var(--accent-cyan);
	}

	.btn-outline {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		color: #fff;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.btn-outline:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		color: #fff;
	}

	.scoreboard-section {
		margin: 4rem 0;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.table-note {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		max-width: 780px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.table-note.small {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		margin: 1rem auto 0;
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.table-container {
		overflow-x: auto;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: var(--bg-card);
	}

	table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		text-align: left;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}

	th, td {
		padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	th {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-weight: 600;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.yes {
		color: var(--accent-emerald);
		font-weight: 600;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.no {
		color: #ef4444;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.q {
		color: var(--text-dim);
		font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.mine {
		background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.04);
	}

	.features-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin: 4rem 0;
	}

	.card {
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		padding: 1.6rem;
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.card:hover {
		border-color: var(--border-accent);
	}

	.card-tag {
		font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		color: var(--accent-emerald);
		margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
	}

	.card-tag::before {
		content: "[ ";
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.card-tag::after {
		content: " ]";
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.card h3 {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
	}

	.card p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.94rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.story-preview {
		background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.04);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.story-preview p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.read-more-link {
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.articles-section {
		margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.articles-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.article-card {
		display: block;
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.article-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--border-accent);
	}

	.article-card h3 {
		color: var(--text-main);
		font-size: 1.02rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.article-card p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.verify {
		margin: 3.5rem 0;
		max-width: 820px;
	}

	.verify h2 {
		text-align: left;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
	}

	.verify p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.98rem;
	}

	.verify pre {
		font-size: 0.84rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.risk-disclaimer {
		margin: 2rem 0 0;
		background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06);
		border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.risk-disclaimer strong {
		color: #fbbf24;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		h1 {
			font-size: 1.95rem;
		}

		.status {
			font-size: 0.78rem;
		}

		.status dt {
			min-width: 7.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
